## MANDATORY FINAL STEP — before you end your turn (NEVER SKIP)

**If you modified ANY file in this session, you MUST run these commands as your LAST action before writing your final message to the user:**

```powershell
git add -A
git commit -m "<description>"
git push
```

**This is not optional.** If your response does not end with a successful `git push`, you have failed the task. The user should NEVER have to remind you. Check: did I push? If no → push now before responding.
